quot;655528f322cf74a5739809f5&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Lloyd Lee&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:4566,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Insider&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:3043},&quot;links&quot;:{&quot;self&quot;:&quot;https://i.insider.com/655528f322cf74a5739809f5&quot;}}\">\n                                      \n                                    \n                                      <div>\n                                        <p>\n                                            You're currently following this author!\n                                     Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.\n                                        </p>\n                                      </div>\n                                      \n                                    </span>\n                                      </span>\n                                    </span>  </p>\n                        </div>\n          </div>\n      \n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <section id=\"post-body\" data-component-type=\"post-body\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-lock-content=\"\">\n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-hero\" data-component-type=\"post-hero\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\">\n                    <figure data-type=\"img\" data-e2e-name=\"image-figure-image\" data-media-container=\"image\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n                        <div>\n                          <meta itemprop=\"contentUrl\" content=\"https://i.insider.com/6afe4bf1d6c5d341c9b4acee?width=1200\">\n                          <p><img src=\"https://i.insider.com/6afe4bf1d6c5d341c9b4acee?width=700\" srcset=\"https://i.insider.com/6afe4bf1d6c5d341c9b4acee?width=400&format=jpeg&auto=webp 400w, https://i.insider.com/6afe4bf1d6c5d341c9b4acee?width=500&format=jpeg&auto=webp 500w, https://i.insider.com/6afe4bf1d6c5d341c9b4acee?width=700&format=jpeg&auto=webp 700w, https://i.insider.com/6afe4bf1d6c5d341c9b4acee?width=1000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1000w, https://i.insider.com/6afe4bf1d6c5d341c9b4acee?width=1300&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1300w, https://i.insider.com/6afe4bf1d6c5d341c9b4acee?width=2000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 2000w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 900px\" alt=\"Tesla Model Y\" decoding=\"sync\">\n                        </p></div>\n                    \n                          <figcaption data-e2e-name=\"image-caption\">\n                            <details>\n                              <summary aria-label=\"Image caption\">\n                                  <span data-e2e-name=\"image-source\" itemprop=\"creditText\">Harald Tittel/picture alliance via Getty Images</span>              </summary>\n                              <span>Tesla Robotaxi uses a fleet of Model Ys, but the terms of service limit seating to 4 people.</span>\n                            </details>\n                          </figcaption>\n                    </figure>\n              </div>\n    \n    \n    \n          \n    \n            <div data-e2e-name=\"post-details\">\n                \n                \n                \n                \n                  <p><time data-timestamp=\"2026-11-19T02:29:00.049Z\" data-disable-relative-formatting=\"\">\n                      2026-11-19T02:29:00.049Z\n                    </time>\n                  </p>\n              </div>\n    \n    \n          \n    \n            \n            \n            \n    \n          \n    \n      <section data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" data-component-type=\"image-modal\" data-track-content=\"\" data-post-type=\"story\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-body-content\">\n                \n                      <p><a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/tesla-ceo-elon-musk\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">Elon Musk</a> said Tesla plans to develop a steering-wheel-free, pedal-free version of the Model Y capable of carrying six or seven passengers, though he didn't explain how the company would configure the vehicle's interior.</p><p>The Tesla CEO said on Wednesday at The New York Times DealBook Summit that <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/tesla-cybercab-autonomy-subscription-terms-conditions-remote-bricked-2026-11\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">the Cybercab</a> — a two-seater coupe with no steering wheel or pedals — will cover most of the passenger miles driven for the company's robotaxi service, but the need for a bigger autonomous car is still there.</p><p>\"If you've got a whole family in the car, you still need autonomous vehicles for that, so what we plan to do is have an autonomous version of Model Y that wouldn't have steering wheels and pedals and would be good for transporting groups of six or seven people,\" Musk said.</p><p><a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/tesla-robotaxi-service-issues-user-reports-houston-routing-problems-2026-10\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">Tesla Robotaxi</a> already uses Model Ys in its autonomous vehicle fleet, but it can transport only up to four passengers.</p><p>A robotaxi capable of carrying six or seven passengers would give Tesla a way to serve larger groups, a segment of the US autonomous ride-hailing market that remains relatively underserved.</p><p>Waymo's Ojai, which is supposed to be the company's more spacious vehicle platform compared to the Jaguar SUVs, can fit up to four people.</p><p>Uber plans to launch robotaxis with Lucid's Gravity SUV, which the ride-hailing company said can seat six people.</p>\n                \n                \n                  </section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      </section>\n\n    \n    <!-- Included desktop \"post-aside\" -->    \n\n    \n      \n      <section data-component-type=\"post-bottom\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-bottom\">\n        <section>\n    \n    \n            \n            \n    \n            \n            \n            <section data-component-type=\"read-next\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next\" data-display-size=\"4\" data-post-id=\"6afe3ff1a39a61840d333319\" data-root-margin=\"250px 0px\" data-track-view=\"{&quot;subscription_experience&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;}\">\n              <h2>Read next</h2>\n            \n              <div data-track-click-shared=\"{&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;,&quot;click_text&quot;:&quot;Read next&quot;}\" data-recommendations-content=\"\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next-list\" data-recommendations-list=\"\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    <article data-component-type=\"tout\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-post-id=\"post\">\n                     \n                          \n                            <span>    <p><img data-src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" data-old-src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1 1'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" alt=\"\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            </p>  </span>\n                          \n    